t the satellite internet system Starlink is being restricted in Ukraine. How dependent is the country on the system, and what would happen if it went down?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Populist Czech PM Babis goes empty-handed in Senate elections</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e605d9efb3e0290ae9e8f78eda1350270d1ab27167374aa0835458dbbaa146df</id><updated>2026-10-19T04:55:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T07:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/populist-czech-pm-babis-goes-empty-handed-in-senate-elections/a-79690934--95037aa1aa28.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/populist-czech-pm-babis-goes-empty-handed-in-senate-elections/a-79690934?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Opposition parties still control the Czech Senate, in a major blow to Prime Minister Andrej Babis' and his governing coalition.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ilhan Omar: The US Democrat targeted by Donald Trump</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8106b176ac566f951e296c53ffcd991f6046eae9674db600585e0ef1ed63e518</id><updated>2026-10-19T04:55:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-17T19:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ilhan-omar-the-us-democrat-targeted-by-donald-trump/a-79688445--0b2fbb5ba398.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ilhan-omar-the-us-democrat-targeted-by-donald-trump/a-79688445?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump has described her as "garbage" and a "criminal" who does nothing but "bitch." Congress member Ilhan Omar has long been the target of angry verbal attacks from the US president. But why her?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>China's influence in the gaming industry is growing</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e4ec03071008ac70e5c2571005a8adb12a06aa37fceebba762b348ca49b093d3</id><updated>2026-10-19T04:55:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-17T14:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/china-s-influence-in-the-gaming-industry-is-growing/a-79484755--447380e7608a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/china-s-influence-in-the-gaming-industry-is-growing/a-79484755?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Home to more than 700 million gamers, China is the world's largest gaming market — but it's also one of the most tightly regulated. The effects reach far beyond China, impacting players around the world.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Russia wants blackout in Ukraine as winter comes — Zelenskyy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c89827abd890a36d4ea282551d18bcb052368ee46c6dcb9c565a91b5d132d3f6</id><updated>2026-10-19T04:55:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-17T11:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russia-wants-blackout-in-ukraine-as-winter-comes-zelenskyy/a-79686703--c66cb23b1a91.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russia-wants-blackout-in-ukraine-as-winter-comes-zelenskyy/a-79686703?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ukrainian President Zelenskyy says Russia is trying to cut electricity and heating to civilians ahead of winter. He also called the US president's waiver of new sanctions on Moscow a boost for Vladimir Putin.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>France: Protesters clash with police in nationwide protests, amid rising social polarization</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b7ccd2843afb5f720128fc3604596c61e7d0084ca6b011d6f91bbaf424056c6a</id><updated>2026-10-19T04:55:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-17T08:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/france-protesters-clash-with-police-in-nationwide-protests-amid-rising-social-polarization/a-79685584--b410e6f9b726.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/france-protesters-clash-with-police-in-nationwide-protests-amid-rising-social-polarization/a-79685584?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Unrest broke out in parts of France as students, trade unionists and Yellow Vest activists took to the streets to protest high prices and inequality. Police arrested over 1,000 people amid chaotic scenes.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Oregon school shooting: Police praise 'heroism' of those who intervened to stop more killing</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6ff010c85a51f70ffa5cbd355dd7f94d4c5884d95fde71860092f98aed1ab6ff</id><updated>2026-10-19T04:55:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-17T06:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/oregon-school-shooting-police-praise-heroism-of-those-who-intervened-to-stop-more-killing/a-79685302--68385910c32e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/oregon-school-shooting-police-praise-heroism-of-those-who-intervened-to-stop-more-killing/a-79685302?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">US police have praised the actions of three people who cut short a deadly shooting at a school in the state of Oregon. Three children and a teacher were killed in the attack, carried out by a former pupil at the school.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ukrainian President Zelenskyy speaks at EU summit amid spat with Donald Trump</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f656e6e8bde153553b3ef29cfa22355dfa94556d4466448320c182f39629e04b</id><updated>2026-10-19T04:55:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T19:42:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukrainian-president-zelenskyy-speaks-at-eu-summit-amid-spat-with-donald-trump/a-79684340--6307cb90b3ba.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukrainian-president-zelenskyy-speaks-at-eu-summit-amid-spat-with-donald-trump/a-79684340?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">EU leaders reaffirmed support for Ukraine at the Brussels summit. But souring relations with the US over Russia and Starlink and a big hole in the budget will make for a difficult winter for Ukraine.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Hijab ban at schools in Azerbaijan: What's behind the rare wave of protests?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:08ebefd989d279c7be8699b86c416fc4866a118bd15967d23e1ab967dd6a79f8</id><updated>2026-10-19T04:55:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T17:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/hijab-ban-at-schools-in-azerbaijan-what-s-behind-the-rare-wave-of-protests/a-79683716--35e52a17baf3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/hijab-ban-at-schools-in-azerbaijan-what-s-behind-the-rare-wave-of-protests/a-79683716?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Girls wearing headscarves have been turned away from schools in Azerbaijan, triggering unusual protests involving children. The government rules do not mention hijabs. Why are schools enforcing unwritten rules?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>The murder of a young mother in Iran has once again sparked debate on femicide and the social acceptance of violence against women.</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e70ec12e69a3d634a90ae7d601733e95496e55ee70bcf865e50bbc3404284390</id><updated>2026-10-19T04:56:42Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T14:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/the-murder-of-a-young-mother-in-iran-has-once-again-sparked-debate-on-femicide-and-the-social-accept/a-79681977--0dbaaaebbc74.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/the-murder-of-a-young-mother-in-iran-has-once-again-sparked-debate-on-femicide-and-the-social-acceptance-of-violence-against-women/a-79681977?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The murder of a young mother has once again sparked debate in Iran over so-called honor killings, the social acceptance of violence against women and the lack of protection for people vulnerable to gender-based violence.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
